        skos:definition        "{\"node\": {\n    \"country\": \"United States\",\n    \"notes\": \"Multiple hull situation. Data in WOD for 1944-1945. Possibly correspond to AMc 108 (1942-1944), but she sank in 1944 so 1945 cruises look odd. Data in WOD for 1954-1968 correspond to MSO 472 (1954-1970). Data in WOD for 1980 from US Coastguard indicate a third possible Valor, but no reference found.\"\n}}"@en;
