        skos:definition        "{\"node\": {\n    \"decommissioned\": \"1986-02-10\",\n    \"platformclass\": \"vessel of opportunity\",\n    \"notes\": \"Ro/ro vessel built 1978 as Atlantic Project (UK). Re-registered in Malta 28 Feb 1981 and renamed Merzario Hispania and renamed Stena Hispania 18 Nov 1983. Re-registered in the UK again and renamed Kotka Violet 2 Dec 1984, then reverted to Stena Hispania 24 Jan 1985.  Renamed Stena Britannica 12 Feb 1986.  Subsequently re-registered and renamed. As at Sep 2006 she is active as the Swedish registered vessel Finnforest.\",\n    \"previous_name\": \"Kotka Violet, Stena Hispania, Merzario Hispania, Atlantic Project\",\n    \"commissioned\": \"1985-01-24\"\n}}"@en;
